## [tx] Action-bar overlay while looking at claimed land. %1$s = the claim's corner coordinates
## [tx] (e.g. "12,60,3 → 44,80,19"), %2$s = an owner/admin label (viewer_admin, viewer_admin_named
## [tx] or viewer_owner_named).
jm_at.claims.viewer_bar=§c§l[Claim]§r (%1$s) %2$s
